  "body": "Prompting to unload a document [fires `beforunload` event with `BeforeUnloadEvent` for its event interface](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#unloading-documents). \r\n\r\n>Let event be the result of creating an event using BeforeUnloadEvent.\r\n\r\nHowever, [the OnBeforeUnloadEventHandlerNonNull callback](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#onbeforeunloadeventhandlernonnull) defines its param type as broader`Event`.\r\n\r\nCan this be narrowed to `BeforeUnloadEvent`?",
